  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Government of Cote dIvoire to improve the management of their ivory stockpiles,</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(1) digitizing the current ivory stockpile and establishing a clear and accountable chain of custody and management process; (2) installing a database and server to archive inventory data and allow for real-time and remote access to that data; and (3) training administrators to effectively operate the stockpile management system.</narrative>
